WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.652
Knowing how to do something does not always mean

00:00:02.718 --> 00:00:06.336
you may do it Clear communication depends on an

00:00:06.376 --> 00:00:08.968
accurate claim about what you are able and permitted

00:00:08.994 --> 00:00:11.771
to do You may be able to edit a

00:00:11.836 --> 00:00:15.573
diary or a supplier record The ability to use

00:00:15.613 --> 00:00:18.060
the system is different from permission to make the

00:00:18.113 --> 00:00:22.126
decision We will use four separate checks before accepting

00:00:22.231 --> 00:00:27.626
work competence authority information / access and capacity
